# The first full G run. The pin breaks the rump kernel: lwproc_newproc does not copy p_pgrp after 36eddebcc, and NetBSD fixed it in e89b13157d. 1086 of the failed cases run rump_server or a rump client, and 5 more are rump file system tests that crashed. Do not use these counts as the baseline.
